<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Support Page</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
        }

        .main-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .page-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section {
            background-color: #eaeaea;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #343a40;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .faq-question {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .contact-info p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #555;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 1.2rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="main-container">
        <div class="page-title">Support Center</div>

        <!-- Row for FAQ and Technical Support -->
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3 mb-md-0">
                <div class="section h-100">
                    <div class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <p class="faq-question">Q. How do I create an account?</p>
                        <p>Here will be a description of the account information.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <p class="faq-question">Q. Can I access this on mobile?</p>
                        <p>Only if your phone cooperates and Mercury is in retrograde.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="section h-100">
                    <div class="section-title">Technical Support</div>
                    <p><strong>If you are experiencing issues with the website:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Try clearing your browser cache and cookies.</li>
                        <li>Make sure your browser is up to date.</li>
                        <li>Contact our support team if the issue persists.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Row for Contact Section -->
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="section text-center">
                    <div class="section-title">Still Need Help?</div>
                    <p>If you didn’t find your answer here, reach out to our support team:</p>
                    <div class="contact-info">
                        <p>📞 (123) 456-7890</p>
                        <p>📧 support@example.com</p>
                        <p>📍 Philadelphia, PA</p>
                        <p>⏰ Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
